00:45:39,850 --> 00:45:45,850
[VITTI]
Fuck me?    Fine. Jelly? Jelly shoves the guy to the parapet at the edge of the roof, grabs him by the legs and hangs him over the side of the building. The guy screams.
ເຈເລຍ? ເຈເລີຊຸກຍູ້ຜູ້ຊາຍໄປຫາ parapet ຢູ່ແຄມຂອງເຮືອນຫລັງ
